l physical or mental energy", "meaning_zh": "使筋疲力尽", "meaning_status": "ai_draft"}, {"stable_id": "bv1at4y1579f-ch21-0151", "part_of_speech": "verb", "meaning_en": "to become tired or weakened after effort", "meaning_zh": "感到疲劳", "meaning_status": "ai_draft"}, {"stable_id": "bv1at4y1579f-ch21-0152", "part_of_speech": "adjective", "meaning_en": "feeling dizzy and likely to lose consciousness", "meaning_zh": "头晕的，快要晕倒的", "meaning_status": "ai_draft"}, {"stable_id": "bv1at4y1579f-ch21-0153", "part_of_speech": "adjective", "meaning_en": "lacking physical strength, especially due to age or illness", "meaning_zh": "虚弱的，衰弱的", "meaning_status": "ai_draft"}, {"stable_id": "bv1at4y1579f-ch21-0154", "part_of_speech": "adjective", "meaning_en": "feeling very tired, especially after prolonged effort", "meaning_zh": "疲倦的，厌倦的", "meaning_status": "ai_draft"}, {"stable_id": "bv1at4y1579f-ch21-0155", "part_of_speech": "verb", "meaning_en": "to make something or someone less strong or effective", "meaning_zh": "削弱，使变弱", "meaning_status": "ai_draft"}, {"stable_id": "bv1at4y1579f-ch21-0156", "part_of_speech": "adjective", "meaning_en": "causing or feeling slight pain or discomfort", "meaning_zh": "不舒服的，不自在的", "meaning_status": "ai_draft"}, {"stable_id": "bv1at4y1579f-ch21-0157", "part_of_speech": "adjective", "meaning_en": "not awake or aware of one's surroundings", "meaning_zh": "失去知觉的，昏迷的", "meaning_status": "ai_draft"}]}
